        "## Text", "",
        "**bold**, *italic*, ~~strikethrough~~, ==highlight==, =={green}green highlight==, `inline code`, X^2^, H~2~O and <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>.", "",
        "## Lists", "",
        "- one", "  - nested", "    - deeper", "- two", "", "1. first", "2. second", "", "- [ ] a task", "- [x] a finished task", "",
        "## Quote, code and table", "",
